  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thematic Voluntary Contribution to the Prevention and Treatment of Non-Communicable Diseases 2020-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish funds are softly earmarked to WHO&#x2019;s work in relation to non-communicable diseases that represents an increasing health challenge to low and middle income countries. This will allow WHO to align its activities in this field with agreed priorities and ensure follow up to commitments made at the high-level meeting on NCDs in New York in 2018 and be in line with Denmark&#x2019;s particular priority and expertise in this field.</narrative>
  </description>
